// cross_mod_arrayelem_mismatch_reject — the mirror arm of
// cross_mod_array_return_elem_ok: with true element kinds on imported
// returns, `int[] bad = lib.mk(2)` (float[] return) must be REJECTED as a
// cross-element array conversion. Pre-v1.12 the int[] placeholder let
// this compile and run on garbage.
float[] mk(int n) {
    float[] a = new float[n];
    a[0] = 1.5;
    if (n > 1) a[1] = 2.5;
    return a;
}
